				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				141,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Expose debug variables and refactor alert prompts\n\nEnhance the `_InstallSkyBridgeOnce` function in `Bridge.ts` by exposing execution metadata to `globalThis`. Introduce `__CEL_LAST_SET_HTML_INFO__` for the initial render and `__CEL_LATEST_SET_HTML_INFO__` for every subsequent `set-html` invocation. These objects store view state, snapshot data, and timestamps to support the external debug server's `/eval` endpoint.\n\nSimultaneously, refactor `window.confirm` and `window.prompt` calls within the action selection logic. Replace escaped newline characters (`\\n\\n`) with actual literal line breaks in the prompt strings to ensure consistent formatting across browser dialogs.\n\nThese changes improve developer observability into the UI rendering pipeline and standardize user interaction prompts.",
			"SHA": "1e842c614ce6aa7b37312684776d08f330328d0f"
